Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:21.81,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“Contributions aren't the
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:21.81,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}value of open source.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:21.81,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}Feedback is.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,One that I used to hear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:03.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,more is that the value
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.48,0:00:04.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,of open source is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:05.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,getting contributions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:06.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Actually
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:08.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,that might be true for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:09.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,some types of software.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:11.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,We've never had really
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:12.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,substantial
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.08,0:00:12.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,contributions from the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:13.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,community
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:14.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,but for us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:15.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,it's always been more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.22,0:00:15.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,about feedback.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:16.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,We'd rather have the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:17.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,feedback and we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,implement it than other
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.44,0:00:20.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,people can implement
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:21.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,stuff in our software.
